From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrick Lawler <patricktlawler@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 17:20:30 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: ipq9574: drop the WCSS nodes

The TP-Link Archer BE550 DTS describes the WCSS reserved memory, smp2p,
remoteproc and wifi nodes itself, as in the version tested on it. Drop
the copies added by the previous patches; their labels clash with the
board's.

Signed-off-by: Patrick Lawler <patricktlawler@gmail.com>
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq9574.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq9574.dtsi
@@ -228,27 +228,6 @@
 			hwlocks = <&tcsr_mutex 3>;
 			no-map;
 		};
-
